Write an SQL query to display:

User's name and email along with the total amount they have paid in 
completed payments (total_paid). 
Only include users with at least one completed payment. 
Order the results by total_paid in descending order.




select u.name , u.email , sum(p.amount) as total_paid from users u join payments p
on u.user_id = p.user_id where p.payment_status = "Completed"  
group by p.user_id order by total_paid desc;
